<span id="alg1.l36.2" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg1.l36.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> cf. Eq. (<a href="#S5.E2" title="In 5 CARVE: Chunk-Aware Reranking for Video Evidence ‣ Rethinking RAG in Long Videos: What to Retrieve and How to Use It?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>)
</span>
