<section id="A6.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">F.3 </span>Error Analysis on Retrieval and Generation</h3>

<div id="A6.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A6.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">To analyze the distribution of failures, we categorized the results into two primary types across Qwen3-VL-8B and 32B scales. <span id="A6.SS3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Case 1</span>, represents both retrieval and generation fail, and <span id="A6.SS3.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Case 2</span>, represents retrieving success but the generator fails to produce the correct answer. As shown in Table <a href="#A6.T17" title="Table 17 ‣ F.3 Error Analysis on Retrieval and Generation ‣ Appendix F Additional Analysis ‣ Rethinking RAG in Long Videos: What to Retrieve and How to Use It?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">17</span></a>, for the 8B model, Case 1 and Case 2 occurred in <math id="A6.SS3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n=92" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>92</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n=92</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A6.SS3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n=108" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>108</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n=108</annotation></semantics></math> instances, respectively. As the generator scale increased to 32B, these frequencies decreased to <math id="A6.SS3.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n=86" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>86</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n=86</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A6.SS3.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n=104" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>104</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n=104</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A6.T17" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 17: </span>Retrieval cases where generation fails, across two generator scales.</figcaption>
<table id="A6.T17.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="A6.T17.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A6.T17.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_th_row ltx_border_tt" style="padding:0.25pt 4.0pt;"><span id="A6.T17.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Case</span></th>
<th id="A6.T17.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_th_row ltx_border_tt" style="padding:0.25pt 4.0pt;"><span id="A6.T17.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Retrieval</span></th>
<th id="A6.T17.2.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt" style="padding:0.25pt 4.0pt;"><span id="A6.T17.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Qwen3-VL-8B</span></th>
<th id="A6.T17.2.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt" style="padding:0.25pt 4.0pt;"><span id="A6.T17.2.1.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Qwen3-VL-32B</span></th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="A6.T17.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A6.T17.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_t" style="padding:0.25pt 4.0pt;">Case 1</th>
<th id="A6.T17.2.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_t" style="padding:0.25pt 4.0pt;">Fail</th>
<td id="A6.T17.2.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t" style="padding:0.25pt 4.0pt;">92</td>
<td id="A6.T17.2.2.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t" style="padding:0.25pt 4.0pt;">86</td></tr>
<tr id="A6.T17.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A6.T17.2.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_bb" style="padding:0.25pt 4.0pt;">Case 2</th>
<th id="A6.T17.2.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_bb" style="padding:0.25pt 4.0pt;">Hit</th>
