<section id="A7" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix G </span>Prompts</h2>

<section id="A7.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">G.1 </span>QA Generation Prompt</h3>

<div id="A7.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A7.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Figure <a href="#A7.F5" title="Figure 5 ‣ G.1 QA Generation Prompt ‣ Appendix G Prompts ‣ Rethinking RAG in Long Videos: What to Retrieve and How to Use It?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a> presents the prompt used to generate visually grounded QA pairs from egocentric video segments, with each question anchored to a unique observable event in the frames.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A7.F5" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2606.13141v1/QA_generation_QA_generation_prompt.svg" id="A7.F5.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_portrait" style="aspect-ratio:381/699;" width="381" height="699"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 5: </span>Prompt for QA Generation.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A7.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">G.2 </span>QA Filtering Prompt</h3>

<div id="A7.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A7.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Figure <a href="#A7.F6" title="Figure 6 ‣ G.2 QA Filtering Prompt ‣ Appendix G Prompts ‣ Rethinking RAG in Long Videos: What to Retrieve and How to Use It?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a> shows the prompt used to verify whether each generated QA pair is answerable from the provided frames and whether the answer is correct.
In addition, Figure <a href="#A7.F7" title="Figure 7 ‣ G.2 QA Filtering Prompt ‣ Appendix G Prompts ‣ Rethinking RAG in Long Videos: What to Retrieve and How to Use It?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a> presents the prompt used to check whether a question can be answered without visual input, using only common sense and the question itself.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A7.F6" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2606.13141v1/QA_generation_QA_filter_GPT_answerability_prompt.svg" id="A7.F6.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:381/66;" width="381" height="66"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 6: </span>Prompt for GPT Answerability Filtering.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A7.F7" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2606.13141v1/QA_generation_QA_filter_GPT_blind_check_prompt.svg" id="A7.F7.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:381/64;" width="381" height="64"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 7: </span>Prompt for GPT Blind Check Filtering.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A7.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">G.3 </span>LLM Judge Prompt</h3>

<div id="A7.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A7.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Figure <a href="#A7.F8" title="Figure 8 ‣ G.3 LLM Judge Prompt ‣ Appendix G Prompts ‣ Rethinking RAG in Long Videos: What to Retrieve and How to Use It?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a> presents the prompt used by the LLM judge to evaluate whether a candidate answer matches the key factual content of the reference answer.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A7.F8" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2606.13141v1/llm_judge_prompt.svg" id="A7.F8.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:381/303;" width="381" height="303"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 8: </span>Prompt for LLM Judge.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A7.SS4" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">G.4 </span>Memory Generation Prompt</h3>

<div id="A7.SS4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A7.SS4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Figure <a href="#A7.F9" title="Figure 9 ‣ G.4 Memory Generation Prompt ‣ Appendix G Prompts ‣ Rethinking RAG in Long Videos: What to Retrieve and How to Use It?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a> presents the prompt used to generate text-clip memories that summarize what the camera wearer sees, does, and experiences over an egocentric video clip.
In addition, Figure <a href="#A7.F10" title="Figure 10 ‣ G.4 Memory Generation Prompt ‣ Appendix G Prompts ‣ Rethinking RAG in Long Videos: What to Retrieve and How to Use It?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">10</span></a> presents the prompt used to generate text-keyframe memories that describe the camera wearer’s visual experience at a specific moment in detail.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A7.F9" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2606.13141v1/memory_prompt_text_course_prompt.svg" id="A7.F9.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:381/151;" width="381" height="151"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 9: </span>Prompt for Text Clip Memory Generation.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A7.F10" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2606.13141v1/memory_prompt_text_fine_prompt.svg" id="A7.F10.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:381/144;" width="381" height="144"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 10: </span>Prompt for Text Key Frame Memory Generation.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A7.SS5" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">G.5 </span>QA Answering Prompt</h3>

<div id="A7.SS5.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A7.SS5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Figure <a href="#A7.F11" title="Figure 11 ‣ G.5 QA Answering Prompt ‣ Appendix G Prompts ‣ Rethinking RAG in Long Videos: What to Retrieve and How to Use It?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">11</span></a> presents the prompt used to answer questions from retrieved textual descriptions, including either keyframe or clip memory contexts.
In addition, Figure <a href="#A7.F12" title="Figure 12 ‣ G.5 QA Answering Prompt ‣ Appendix G Prompts ‣ Rethinking RAG in Long Videos: What to Retrieve and How to Use It?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">12</span></a> presents the prompt used to answer questions from combined textual memories that include both clip-level descriptions and keyframe-level descriptions.
Furthermore, Figure <a href="#A7.F13" title="Figure 13 ‣ G.5 QA Answering Prompt ‣ Appendix G Prompts ‣ Rethinking RAG in Long Videos: What to Retrieve and How to Use It?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">13</span></a> shows the prompt used to answer questions from retrieved video segments, while Figure <a href="#A7.F14" title="Figure 14 ‣ G.5 QA Answering Prompt ‣ Appendix G Prompts ‣ Rethinking RAG in Long Videos: What to Retrieve and How to Use It?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">14</span></a> shows the prompt used to answer questions from retrieved keyframe images.
Finally, Figure <a href="#A7.F15" title="Figure 15 ‣ G.5 QA Answering Prompt ‣ Appendix G Prompts ‣ Rethinking RAG in Long Videos: What to Retrieve and How to Use It?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">15</span></a> presents the prompt used to answer questions from combined visual evidence, including both video segments and keyframe images.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A7.F11" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2606.13141v1/QA_prompt_text_fine_and_text_coarse_generation_prompt.svg" id="A7.F11.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:381/130;" width="381" height="130"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 11: </span>Prompt for Text Key Frame and Text Clip Answering.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A7.F12" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2606.13141v1/QA_prompt_text_combined_generation_prompt.svg" id="A7.F12.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:381/192;" width="381" height="192"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 12: </span>Prompt for Text Combined Answering.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A7.F13" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2606.13141v1/QA_prompt_visual_coarse_generation_prompt.svg" id="A7.F13.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:381/97;" width="381" height="97"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 13: </span>Prompt for Visual Clip Answering.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A7.F14" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2606.13141v1/QA_prompt_visual_fine_generation_prompt.svg" id="A7.F14.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:381/99;" width="381" height="99"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 14: </span>Prompt for Visual Key Frame Answering.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A7.F15" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2606.13141v1/QA_prompt_visual_combined_generation.svg" id="A7.F15.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:381/110;" width="381" height="110"></object>
